# Authority follows interaction: the guest throws the ball into the pile and its link is cut for
# good while the pile it owns still moves. The host takes every body back from the guest's newest
# state and the pile rests in the host's world.
scenario authority_leave
scene pile60
seed 62
guests 1
end 16s
light_mass 20kg
authority interaction

net g1 rtt 100ms jitter 20ms loss 2%

p1 grab ball as grab
p1 wait 300ms
p1 throw pile31 speed 12 as throw
at 700ms cut g1 for 10s

expect result grab granted
expect result throw done
expect left g1
expect no_stuck
# Measured 20 takes before the cut (seed 62).
expect takes.count >= 1
